## RelationType: enables

Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/enables`. Source definition: a capability enables another capability only if realization of the first capability implies realization of the second capability. This BKN projection stores the target entity ID in `enables_target_id`.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| capability | capability | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| enables_target_id | entity_id |
